      "releaseNotes": "Get ready for a stunning night sky event! Our latest update has everything you need for the Total Lunar Eclipse on March 2-3\n\nCheck out easy-to-follow viewing guides with maps and times, use our interactive eclipse simulator to see how it’ll look from your spot, and get alerts to catch every moment.",
      "version": "3.0.12",
